  "body": "Refs #24\n\nAdd a horizontal flexible navigation bar for 600 to 839 dp. It keeps three to five 112 dp destinations centered. Each destination has a logical-leading icon, a label that can wrap, and the same stable ID as its compact counterpart. The caller keeps selection and page state.\n\nThe Gallery retains page, keyboard focus and selection across 599 and 600 dp. Existing vertical navigation builders keep their interfaces.\n\nThe exact candidate ran 1,600 Rust tests and three WebAssembly compile checks. Apple Metal passed 18 offscreen tests. Two headless native replays produced four original PNGs. Headless Chrome WebGPU passed 364 Material steps and 30,249 checks. The original captures cover light and dark, RTL and 200% text.\n\n[Exact source, commands, reports and original PNGs](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/fa9c096b28747b91d597120e3194decfc31da4b4/docs/evidence/md3/horizontal-navigation-bar-v0173-corrected-runtime)\n",
  "changed_files": 11,
